SIZE 35 mm, 25 mm
GAP 3 mm, 0 mm
DIRECTION 0,0
REFERENCE 0,0
OFFSET 0 mm
SET PEEL OFF
SET CUTTER OFF
SET PARTIAL_CUTTER OFF
SET TEAR ON
CLS
CODEPAGE 1252
; Body is generated by _print_marker_label. TSPL's own alignment argument is
; not supported across all TSC firmware, so every line is given the same x,
; which lines them up on the left. That x is _MARKER_X in test_console.py,
; set from printed labels; change it there if the stock changes.
@body@
PRINT 1,1
